{"availability":"available","full":"anfaznil/acuity","name":"acuity","description":"Drop a PDF, get flashcards. Claude-powered study app with 6 game modes — Next.js on Vercel.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T03:43:20Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:05:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://acuity-study.vercel.app","topics":["anthropic","claude","flashcards","nextjs","pdf","vercel"],"demo":"https://acuity-study.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:18.647Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:18.647Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:18.647Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:59.065Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:20:18.647Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Drop in a PDF of lecture notes, a textbook chapter or a study guide. Claude turns it into a flashcard set in seconds, and you study it with six game modes, XP, levels and streaks.","Recorded on the live site: samples/cell-biology.pdf → 15 cards → Flashcards mode."],"features":["PDF → flashcards with AI. Upload up to 5 PDFs at once, or paste text. Choose the card count (auto, 10, 20 or 40), the style (term/definition, Q&A or mixed) and an optional focus (\"chapter 3, key dates\").","Scanned PDFs work too. If a PDF has no selectable text, the file is sent to Claude as a document so it can read the pages directly.","Review before saving. Edit, delete, add or swap cards, and rename the set. Claude suggests the title, description and emoji.","Gamified progress. XP, levels, a daily goal, streaks, achievements, per-card mastery (0–5) and personal bests.","Sync across devices. Sign in with a username and password and your sets, XP and streaks follow you to your phone, tablet and laptop. Signing in is optional: without it, everything stays in the browser, and you can still…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anfaznil/acuity/blob/main/README.md","f